     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>To help you more effectively with questions about our products or any issues you may have, it is possible for us to establish a remote connection to your computer in real time.</strong></p> <p>Please understand that this is only possible by appointment.<br/>Please contact us for</p> <p>measuring machines / external tool management:<br/><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://zoller-group.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/44\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Service request\">Request Service</a></p> <p>TMS Tool Management Solutions:<br/><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://zoller-group.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/7\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Support request\">Request Support</a></p> <p>If you are having trouble downloading or executing the ZOLLER Online Support applications, this may be because your system administrator has blocked them. In this case, please contact your local administrator. They may be able to offer an alternative option.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
